msgid "Each delay starts when the page's popup response arrives. Eligible popups display one at a time, in delay/ID order. Navigation cancels pending displays and closes visible popups; eligibility is checked again before display. End dates also close visible popups. Dialog popups support an optional image; bottom banners do not. Popups scheduled to start later become eligible on a subsequent page load/navigation."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/@taon-dev/marketing/README.component.html:45
msgid "Visitor display counts use localStorage; once-per-session uses sessionStorage (a browser-tab session). Counts are incremented on display, not on fetch. These are browser-local limits, not authenticated-user or cross-device limits; clearing storage resets them. If storage is unavailable or corrupt, rendering fails closed and reports an error rather than ignoring restrictions."
msgstr ""

